# Icons — Lucide React

All UI icons in this workspace must come from **`lucide-react`**.

## Do

- Import icons from `lucide-react`: `import { Search, Trash2 } from 'lucide-react'`
- Use shared defaults from `agent-frontend/src/components/icons/icon-props.ts` when sizing/stroke should match the app shell
- Reuse existing mapping helpers (`NavPageIcon`, `AgentMenuIcon`, `AdminActionIcons`) when they already wrap Lucide icons
- Set `aria-hidden` on decorative icons; pair with visible text or `title` on the control

## Don't

- Hand-write inline `<svg>` paths for UI icons
- Add other icon libraries (Heroicons, react-icons, Font Awesome, etc.)
- Use text characters as icons (`+`, `×`, `✎`) in buttons — use Lucide instead
- Use CSS mask sprites for icons when a Lucide equivalent exists

## Defaults

```tsx
import { Pencil } from 'lucide-react';
import { iconProps } from '../components/icons/icon-props';

<Pencil {...iconProps()} />
<Pencil {...iconProps({ size: 18 })} />
```

- Default size: **16** (`ICON_SIZE`), large controls: **18** (`ICON_SIZE_LG`)
- Default stroke: **1.5** (`ICON_STROKE`)

## Common mappings

| Use case | Lucide icon |
|----------|-------------|
| Edit | `Pencil` |
| Delete | `Trash2` |
| View | `Eye` |
| Download | `Download` |
| Move to folder | `FolderInput` |
| Search | `Search` |
| Close | `X` |
| Folder / file | `Folder`, `File` |
